  "2026-11-06T22:02:58.458Z",codex-agent,"Greptile thread PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M60tI8A is valid and fixed. Independent repair preserves real signed direct-workflow verification, then resolves a reusable signer through the signed invocation hint and authoritative original-run repository/main/commit/workflow/attempt plus canonical reusable reference. It performs the same cryptographic verification after lookup; missing or ambiguous metadata and failed signatures never authorize repair. Added only actions-read to recover. The tracker-linked targeted command passed 40 tests, zero failures/skips; focused provenance coverage passed 28 tests at unchanged 100/100/100/100. Thirteen paired behavioral proofs each failed one focused test under mutation and passed after restoration: recovery mode dispatch; legacy direct compatibility; reusable cryptographic verification; original run repository; original run commit; original run attempt; same-repository invocation hint; canonical original reusable path; original reusable SHA binding; local reusable signer compatibility; unavailable original run refusal; recovery workflow verifier mode; recovery Actions read permission. Together with the previous 22 this resume has 35 paired proofs; the owned loop has 87. No full local suite was repeated and no confidence/coverage threshold was changed."
